Subject: [PATCH] feat: AI Coach sees the smart-scale and photo food-log lines

VictorCoachExtras appends ScaleCoachContext and FoodCoachContext under the
same consent gate as the strap metrics, in both the chat and the streamed
chat paths (the morning brief goes through chat). Best-effort: each line is
absent when there is no data.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
